  "title": "Broccoli Cheese Bake",
  "description": "This broccoli bake is a tasty breadcrumb-free twist on au gratin! Easily customizable, make it with skim milk, fat-free cheese, or with or without eggs.",
  "authors": [
    "Leslie A"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-06-19T15:11:28-04:00",
